	Agent: risk level, best work, and what it does, in plain words.
	Work events (Events/LCorp_Work.luau) unlock an entry when an Agent first works the
	unit; research and outsider events unlock the rest. The Archive is kept across lives,
	so what one life learns the hard way, the next life can read before choosing.
]]

